{"version":2,"seriesID":"the-tony-randall-show-1976","tvmazeID":35812,"title":"The Tony Randall Show","yearStart":1976,"yearEnd":1978,"overview":"Tony Randall plays a newly-elected Philadelphia municipal judge named Walter Franklin in The Tony Randall Show, which premiered in the Bicentennial Year of 1976.The Tony Randall Show is a half-hour comedy series starring Emmy Award-winner Tony Randall as Judge Walter' Franklin, a contemporary courtroom judge in Philadelphia who has as many trials and vexations off the bench as on, it debuted Thursday, Sept. 30, 1976 on ABC-TV. A widower, Franklin lives with his two children, Roberta (Devon Scott), 18, and Oliver Wendell Franklin, 11, along with their housekeeper, Mrs. McClellan (Rachel Roberts). At the courthouse, -he is assisted by his court reporter and confidant, Jack Terwilliger (Barney Martin) and his sharp-tongued, sardonic, secretary, Miss Reubner (Allyn Ann McLerie).","posterURL":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/posters/71727-1.jpg","backdropURL":null,"genres":["Comedy","Family","Legal"],"networks":["CBS"],"creator":null,"seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"episodes":[{"archiveID":"thetonyrandallshow1@s1e01","sourceID":"thetonyrandallshow1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":"Pilot","overview":"Walter Franklin has to cope with a bad case of nerves as he preens for his first date with widow Linda Jenkins in almost two years.","stillURL":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/434/1087288.jpg","airDate":"1976-09-23","year":1976,"runtimeSeconds":1800,"videoFile":{"name":"S01E01- Pilot.mp4","format":"MPEG4","sizeBytes":80139980,"tier":1},"downloadURL":"https://archive.org/download/thetonyrandallshow1/S01E01-%20Pilot.mp4"},{"archiveID":"thetonyrandallshow1@s1e02","sourceID":"thetonyrandallshow1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":"Case: A Question of Qualifications","overview":"Judge Franklin (Tony Randall) must weigh the scales of justice outside the courtroom when he conducts intervi